# The batch's decision reveals its staged entries before every entry of the
# batch was admitted or diverted.
MODULE: AtomicAllOrNothingDecidesEarly
TARGET: AtomicAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the decision is applied while an entry of its batch is still pending
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
    /\ \A e \in AtomicEntries : st[e] # "Pending"
    /\ decided' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ \E e \in AtomicEntries : st[e] # "Pending"
    /\ decided' = TRUE
--- END
